            "review_text": "Tú Stone\nHanoi, Vietnam38 contributions\n0\nHidden Gem\nJan 2022 • Couples\nHidden Gem in the heart of D1, HCMC.\nTricky to find if you are first time but worth it.\nFoods are amazing especially they have the tomahawk steak 🤤\nSmall selection of wine but they all match to the food.\nCocktails and spirits are also available here.\nService was also to the point \nLove this place and will be back\nRead more\nWritten January 5, 2022\nTú Stone\nThank you for the prompt comments :)\nHope to see you soon!\nWritten January 5, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
